If you're "on the go" dipping a unicorn horn into hallucination or
blindness will "clear" it in one dip (turn it to water).  It will turn
sickness into fruit juice too, I believe.  This saves the chance of a
fountain drying up.  If you have to use a fountain, organize your
poitions (dipping 3 uncursed potions of blah counts as a single dip if
they are organized like that, the same with scrolls).  The same
concept applies to alchemy (dipping 4 uncursed potions of healing into
one potion of speed).






